  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan gains it along with mature bamboo chest. It belongs to luck path but has wisdom path effect. Luck Plan Immortal Gu’s power is to make deductions on how to optimize the use of the Gu Immortal’s resources. Ordinary Gu Immortals cultivate one path and rarely take a second, so there are many killer moves that mimic other paths. Those moves are created with limited foundation in the mimicked path. They can be strong, but they are easily countered and the weaknesses are obvious. Compared to actual wisdom path methods, they are less useful.",
      "chapters": [
        1781
      ],
